    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom own-door apartment to the market at No. 15 Hillcrest Manor, Templeogue, Dublin 6W. Ideally positioned within this exclusive and peaceful development, this well-presented property offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a low-maintenance home in a highly desirable South Dublin location. Presented in good, clean condition throughout and benefiting from vacant possession with no onward chain, No. 15 is ready for its new owners to move straight in and make their own.\nHillcrest Manor is a mature and highly regarded residential development, ideally located within easy reach of the many amenities Templeogue and the surrounding areas have to offer. Residents enjoy a wealth of local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and recreational amenities close by, while the beautiful grounds of Bushy Park and Tymon Park are also within easy reach. The development is well served by public transport with numerous Dublin Bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding suburbs, while major road networks including the M50 are easily accessible for commuters.\nNo. 15 offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, extending to approximately 69 sqm of internal floorspace. The property briefly comprises of an entrance hall, spacious living room, separate kitchen/dining area, two generous bedrooms including a master bedroom with ensuite, and a main family bathroom. The own-door entrance provides an added sense of privacy and independence rarely associated with apartment living, while the overall layout is both practical and well suited to modern day living.\nA particular benefit of this property is its position within this quiet and exclusive development, which offers a peaceful residential setting while remaining close to an excellent range of amenities. Ample communal parking is available, providing excellent convenience for residents and visitors alike. The property also boasts a C1 BER rating, offering a solid level of energy efficiency.\nNo. 15 Hillcrest Manor represents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a spacious own-door apartment in a mature and highly sought-after Templeogue location. With its generous proportions, two bathrooms, good condition, C1 BER rating, ample parking and vacant possession with no onward chain, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers. Early viewing is highly advised to appreciate all that this superb home has to offer. For further information or to arrange a viewing, contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers.\nFeatures\n•2-bed / 2-bath own-door apartment\n•BER C1\n•C. 69 sqm of internal floorspace\n•Own-door private entrance\n•Presented in good, clean condition throughout\n•Vacant with no onward chain\n•Exclusive and peaceful residential development\n•Ample communal parking\n•Management fees c. 1744 per annum\n•Master bedroom with ensuite\n•Spacious living accommodation\n•Excellent Templeogue location\n•Close to a wide range of local amenities\n•Easy access to Bushy Park & Tymon Park\n•Excellent public transport links\n•Convenient access to the M50\n•Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors\nDirections\nEircode D6W C803"
      },
      {
